  "id": "lemon-herb-chicken",
  "name": "Lemon Herb Chicken",
  "subtitle": "Skillet chicken with bright lemon and oregano",
  "description": "Tender chicken breasts are seasoned with lemon, browned in olive oil, and finished with oregano and parsley.",
